= AI-Driven DTGEP: Methodology and Architecture <sec:metodologia>

The _AI-Driven DTGEP_ methodology reconceptualizes the software pre-project phase by structuring the methodological framework into an asynchronous model with a strict separation between conversational qualitative elicitation and deterministic algorithmic processing.

In contrast to traditional consulting, where the human engineer must synchronously guide the interview and manually compute evaluation matrices, AI-Driven DTGEP delegates the elicitation phase to an autonomous AI agent. Once the interaction with the stakeholder concludes, the system immediately and automatically executes algorithmic processing, generating an auditable preliminary draft. Subsequently, the software engineer asynchronously validates the extracted variables and final results, eliminating the temporal concurrency bottleneck (@fig:modelo_asincrono).

